16140:### `armbfxwidth32` (med) -- filed 2026-09-07: UBFX/SBFX build their mask with `1 << 32`
16183:>     width == 31   ->  1 << 31   2^31 not representable in `int`    C99 6.5.7p4  <-- MISSED
16202:> yields `INT_MIN` on the common lowering, and `INT_MIN - 1` wraps to `INT_MAX` = `0x7fffffff` --
16203:> which is exactly the correct mask for a 31-bit field.  At width 32 the count-UB gives `1`, the
16204:> mask becomes `0`, and the instruction returns zero instead of the register.
