The final reconciliation found no duplicate ledger IDs, but 121 of the 276 candidate-state rows have no severity. Several shipped repairs remain marked open or held. I also confirmed two useful scope corrections: the five remaining SGI MTE command exits are outside #513’s repair, and `pcc2counter8` overwrites neighboring emulated registers within a bounded array—it is not a host buffer overrun.
