| 3. `n6` | Unrated | **High** | [dev_footbridge.c](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_footbridge.c), `IRQ_ENABLE_SET`, `SDRAM_BA_MASK` | **Yes:** `footbridge_sites_probe.py` | Detailed design/adjudication in ledger; no dedicated `artifacts/n6/` directory | Several disposition groups across **eight** exits | The enable-read arm computes `d->irq_enable` and then terminates. Other arms require different handling. One small subcase does **not** make the whole row EASY. |
